Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Curto<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">10\u00ba Trail Caminho Portugu\u00eas de Santiago<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 2026-10-11 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase \u00danica:<\/strong> 2,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (06\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada com Hist\u00f3ria<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 2026-10-11 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:31<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase \u00danica:<\/strong> 2,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (06\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Jovem<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corridas Jovens (Benjamins a Juvenis)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 2026-10-11 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Gratuito:<\/strong> 0,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (06\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o 10\u00ba Trail Caminho Portugu\u00eas de Santiago do Interior 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 10\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo, <strong>11 de outubro de 2026<\/strong>, com secretariado e partidas concentrados nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es da ACRC Moura Morta, concelho de Castro Daire.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios de partida das provas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As Corridas Jovens iniciam-se \u00e0s 10h00 (930 m a 2.790 m), a partida do Trail Curto de 10 km (278 m D+) ocorre \u00e0s 10h30 e a Caminhada de 7,5 km arranca logo a seguir, \u00e0s 10h31.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais os valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e prazos limite?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A taxa de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 de apenas <strong>2,00 \u20ac<\/strong> para o Trail de 10 km e para a Caminhada de 7,5 km, sendo <strong>gratuita<\/strong> para todos os escal\u00f5es jovens at\u00e9 Juvenis. As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es encerram a 6 de outubro de 2026 na plataforma Stop&#038;Go.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona a premia\u00e7\u00e3o da prova e do circuito municipal?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">S\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos medalh\u00f5es aos 3 primeiros da geral e pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios aos 5 primeiros classificados masculinos e femininos (1\u00ba: 50\u20ac, 2\u00ba: 40\u20ac, 3\u00ba: 30\u20ac, 4\u00ba: 20\u20ac e 5\u00ba: 10\u20ac), medalh\u00f5es aos 3 melhores de cada escal\u00e3o et\u00e1rio e trof\u00e9us para as 5 melhores equipas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o dos participantes?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o confere direito a dorsal com chip descart\u00e1vel (no Trail e escal\u00f5es jovens), seguro desportivo, abastecimentos de percurso e meta, e participa\u00e7\u00e3o no lanche-conv\u00edvio oferecido a todos os atletas durante a entrega de pr\u00e9mios \u00e0s 12h30.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso levantar o dorsal e consultar informa\u00e7\u00f5es finais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado para levantamento de dorsais funciona no dia do evento a partir das 09h00 na sede da ACRC Moura Morta. At\u00e9 48 horas antes da prova, todos os atletas inscritos recebem por e-mail o Manual do Atleta com as recomenda\u00e7\u00f5es t\u00e9cnicas finais.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"10\u00ba Trail Caminho Portugu\u00eas de Santiago do Interior 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-11\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Castro Daire, Viseu\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Castro Daire\", \"addressRegion\": \"Viseu\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o 10\u00ba Trail Caminho Portugu\u00eas de Santiago do Interior 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 10\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo,11 de outubro de 2026, com secretariado e partidas concentrados nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es da ACRC Moura Morta, concelho de Castro Daire.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios de partida das provas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As Corridas Jovens iniciam-se \u00e0s 10h00 (930 m a 2.790 m), a partida do Trail Curto de 10 km (278 m D+) ocorre \u00e0s 10h30 e a Caminhada de 7,5 km arranca logo a seguir, \u00e0s 10h31.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais os valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e prazos limite?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A taxa de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 de apenas2,00 \u20acpara o Trail de 10 km e para a Caminhada de 7,5 km, sendogratuitapara todos os escal\u00f5es jovens at\u00e9 Juvenis. As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es encerram a 6 de outubro de 2026 na plataforma Stop&Go.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona a premia\u00e7\u00e3o da prova e do circuito municipal?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"S\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos medalh\u00f5es aos 3 primeiros da geral e pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios aos 5 primeiros classificados masculinos e femininos (1\u00ba: 50\u20ac, 2\u00ba: 40\u20ac, 3\u00ba: 30\u20ac, 4\u00ba: 20\u20ac e 5\u00ba: 10\u20ac), medalh\u00f5es aos 3 melhores de cada escal\u00e3o et\u00e1rio e trof\u00e9us para as 5 melhores equipas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o dos participantes?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o confere direito a dorsal com chip descart\u00e1vel (no Trail e escal\u00f5es jovens), seguro desportivo, abastecimentos de percurso e meta, e participa\u00e7\u00e3o no lanche-conv\u00edvio oferecido a todos os atletas durante a entrega de pr\u00e9mios \u00e0s 12h30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso levantar o dorsal e consultar informa\u00e7\u00f5es finais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O secretariado para levantamento de dorsais funciona no dia do evento a partir das 09h00 na sede da ACRC Moura Morta. At\u00e9 48 horas antes da prova, todos os atletas inscritos recebem por e-mail o Manual do Atleta com as recomenda\u00e7\u00f5es t\u00e9cnicas finais.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":67713,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed